    "body": "`bip-0375/deps/dleq.py` is a copy of the BIP-374 reference code, used by the BIP-375 validator to check `PSBT_GLOBAL_SP_DLEQ` / `PSBT_IN_SP_DLEQ` proofs. It was taken before #2262, so it still uses the raw challenge hash as `e` and doesn't reject proofs with `e >= n`.\n\nThis applies the same two changes to the copy. After this the functions match `bip-0374/reference.py` line for line (apart from the unit tests). A challenge hash >= n has negligible probability, so nothing changes in practice: `test_runner.py` still passes all 42 vectors, and the 17 BIP-374 verify vectors give the same results before and after. It just keeps the copy from drifting from the spec.\n",
